    "title": "2007 Most Innovative Development Project competition",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Submissions are welcome for the Global Development Network's (GDN) annual competition for the Most Innovative Development Project (MIDP),",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "9f7788c63aed5ed6",
